# Starter Docs — Agent Rules

This repository is **documentation only** (product + tech). No application code.

## Trilogy

```text
docs/ (this repo) · mobile/ · backend/
```

## When given a PRD

1. Do **not** paste the PRD into one file.
2. Split content into the correct folders:

| Content | Destination |
|---------|-------------|
| Map, glossary, repo links | `docs/00-overview/` |
| Vision, personas, stories, specs, roadmap | `docs/01-product/` |
| Stack, architecture, API, auth, errors, … | `docs/02-tech/` |
| Why we chose X | `docs/03-decisions/` (ADR from `template.md`) |
| Setup / envs / deploy | `docs/04-runbooks/` |

3. Keep `TODO` where the PRD is silent.
4. Do not invent product or API details.
5. No secrets in docs.
6. Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for the full checklist.

## Page discipline

- One job per page
- Cross-link; do not duplicate long sections
- Auth docs must list only enabled modes (or mark disabled explicitly)
- Error **codes** are stable; messages may be translated
